{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 23, :comments ["<b>And He said.</b> I said to you time after time: send My son to serve Me, to sacrifice sacrifices to Me, and you refused to send him; therefore I will punish you. Those lacking understanding thought that He is speaking about Moses, and this is madness — and moreover, Eliezer is not the firstborn of Moses."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:31:37.602601334Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}